{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/821950-plot-hook-the-hit-list","id":821950,"title":"[Plot Hook] The Hit List","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-02T16:08:21-08:00","id":821950,"title":"[Plot Hook] The Hit List","content":"So, I was thinking about this NPC demon I am creating for my other story arc (Are you happy now?), and her prelude has evolved into something else for the players.<br /> <br /> <br /> The NPC was a Guardian Angel - Dorothy Meyers. She is the school librarian. She looks to be on her fifty-something now. When she was an Angel her mission was to protect the school, for in the basement every 5 years a student was supposed to be sacrificed. 15 years into the job Dorothy started to - most unfortunately - care for the children, which led to the destruction of the sacrifice room and her fall.<br /> <br /> The Hit List:<br /> <br /> Its been a few months now since the shit-storm passed and no new signs of interest from the GM took place. Until now.<br /> <br /> Dorothy has come across a terrible secret. The place was not being used solely as a sacrifice site, but also as an indoctrination facility. In the year 2000 a few students were transferred to &quot;special&quot; subject class in their senior year, in a room that did not exist. She was finally able to locate it, and its pretty clear what it was used for.<br /> According to the school records, at least 15 students have been in that room.<br /> As she is chewing on what to do next with the information, things took an ugly turn: strangely, the School Director decided to call for a 16 year reunion of the classes of 2000. In a few weeks all of them will be there, together.<br /> <br /> What to do now?<br /> <br /> _________________________________________________<br /> <br /> My question here to those who want to talk: how (and if) you have been using sleeper agents on your stories?<br /> <br /> I also have been thinking on their triggers and what exactly would be their mission, I dont think I want to go with just the classic &quot;kill demons when you see a glitch&quot; or etc, so I would enjoy some thoughts on this.<br /> __________________________________________________<br /> <br /> <br /> ** Ohhh, I just realized it may not be clear why I called it Hit List. It is because if were I a PC in this story, I would just get a list with the names/addresses and try to kill them all o_O.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5690,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5690-mithrael","user":"Mithrael","date":". 02-02-2016, 07:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5690-mithrael","name":"Mithrael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T10:45:54-08:00","id":823494,"title":"","content":"The thing to remember with sleeper agents is that the God-Machine has far more interests than &quot;kill Demons&quot;. Anything that might require a covertly placed asset to make some little nudge, but requires less investment than an Angel, is perfect for a sleeper agent. If criteria met, active and accomplish goal. Subtle, low maintenance, and disposable - optimal options for the Machine.<br /> <br /> But, concrete ideas: play up the G-M's far ranging view. Have a SA do something out of character, innocuous, but only critical in hindsight. May they talk to someone they normally won't, or deliver a package to the wrong address. Only later on does it become clear that this was an important cog in the chain of events that led to the current plot.<br /> <br /> Example: Someone gets brainwashed to be generous if certain criteria are met. Normally, the person would never issue a loan to someone with a grandiose, crackpot scheme. But later on it becomes clear that if said SA didn't finance the early startup, it would have never become Deva Corp or Utopia Now or [Insert Plot Required Organization Here]. Small change, undetectable until it goes off, far reaching effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 02-04-2016, 01:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T14:10:24-08:00","id":823708,"title":"","content":"I really *really* enjoyed this idea of loaning money/startup company , and could fit perfectly nice into the plot. Like the school director decides to &quot;take advantage&quot; of the meeting with the students and tell them he starting a business of his own. Not like as announcement but chit-chatting with the people. If the meeting happens at all it could take a long time for the pc to notice that is happening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5690-mithrael","name":"Mithrael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T14:11:43-08:00","id":823709,"title":"","content":"For added Fun, throw a few Angels in there with cross purposes. One that wants the entire situation &quot;resolved&quot; for mysterious reasons. One that wants to protect everyone on The List. And/Or one that <i>wants</i> them to be killed. Maybe they are necessary for a future Occult Matrix. Maybe their <i>deaths</i> are required by a <i>current</i> Occult Matrix. Any one of said prior Angels could be a loyalist in full compliance with their mission, an Exile trying to muddle their own way, or close to Falling.<br /> <br /> Decide which is which, roll dice to determine, or make it up as you go along.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 02-04-2016, 05:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T14:20:42-08:00","id":823720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mithrael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/821950-plot-hook-the-hit-list?p=823708#post823708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really *really* enjoyed this idea of loaning money/startup company , and could fit perfectly nice into the plot. Like the school director decides to &quot;take advantage&quot; of the meeting with the students and tell them he starting a business of his own. Not like as announcement but chit-chatting with the people. If the meeting happens at all it could take a long time for the pc to notice that is happening.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, and it could very well seem like the director is the one with the important business... or one (or more) of the Sleepers could form their own business in the Aftermath. Or one loans the money (A), and another is triggered to assassinate the director (B) after A is successful, leaving the businesses in the director's partner's hands... just as planned.<br /> <br /> That's the nice thing with G-M plots - they can be as simple or convoluted as you need for your particular purposes, and not seem out of place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T15:20:36-08:00","id":823769,"title":"","content":"If your players have a moral/empathic streak and you want them to be a threat, you could always have them programed to seek out the Unchained and then pull a gun on themselves, explaining that they will be compelled to pull the trigger unless the outcast comes along for recycling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T16:00:38-08:00","id":823815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/821950-plot-hook-the-hit-list?p=823769#post823769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If your players have a moral/empathic streak and you want them to be a threat, you could always have them programed to seek out the Unchained and then pull a gun on themselves, explaining that they will be compelled to pull the trigger unless the outcast comes along for recycling.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tough to plan for. Also an almost guaranteed No Sell, seeing as it is a pointless sacrifice. Demons have so many tools to stop or correct such an obvious ploy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T16:11:43-08:00","id":823832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/821950-plot-hook-the-hit-list?p=823815#post823815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Tough to plan for. Also an almost guaranteed No Sell, seeing as it is a pointless sacrifice. Demons have so many tools to stop or correct such an obvious ploy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, figured it was a stupid idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-04T16:26:02-08:00","id":823850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/821950-plot-hook-the-hit-list?p=823832#post823832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, figured it was a stupid idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, it's not dumb, it just needs more layering. If it was a distraction, for instance, or completes an Occult Matrix the Demon wants stopped (framing it as a cost benefit analysis of Output vs Demon), or if the Demon can be framed for murder, or it involves the Demon's loved ones...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}